<br/>
<br/>Engineers can use <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59359/reinforced-bio-optic-killshades">
<img alt="Reinforced Bio-Optic Killshades" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gizmo_newgoggles.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reinforced Bio-Optic Killshades</span></a> which is significantly stronger than the alternatives, due to its higher item level. It can be socketed with Engineering-only Cogwheel gems like <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59480/fractured-cogwheel">
<img alt="Fractured Cogwheel" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enggizmos_30.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fractured Cogwheel</span></a>, making it highly customizeable which is great for pre-raid gearing.<br/>
<br/>You may notice this set does not use the tier gear available from the Valor Points-vendor. This is not because the gear is bad. It is actually often better than the alternatives. However, you are unlikely to be able to acquire it before your first raid, as other pieces are much more important and you are limited by the amount of valor points you can obtain.<br/>
<br/>Those playing both Frost and Unholy might be excited to find that the pre-raid BiS gearing is almost identical between the two specs. That being said, Frost does primarily dual-wield onehanders and tends to appreciate Mastery a bit more, as a large portion of Frost's damage profile comes from Frost damage, regardless of playing the Masterfrost-build or the "regular" Frost build.<br/>
<br/>
<b>IMPORTANT:</b> The suggested items below are ranked with one option presented as the best, while others are simply "optional". Due to reforging, it is near impossible to rank several optional pieces. Simply put, what is best for you in a sub-optimal gear set might be worse for someone else, as reforging affects this massively. The embedded gear set above has reforges included, but they are seen in the context of you having every item available to you. If you are missing crucial pieces, you likely have to reforge your wait out of potential hit issues.<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="body-armor">
<span class="c6">Body Armor for Frost Death Knight DPS</span></h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="head-for-frost-death-knight-dps">Head for Frost Death Knight DPS</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59359/reinforced-bio-optic-killshades">
<img alt="Reinforced Bio-Optic Killshades" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gizmo_newgoggles.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reinforced Bio-Optic Killshades</span></a> is definitely the choice for your helm for all Plate DPS. The superior item level, stat budget and customizability of this item puts it on a level that is clearly above all the other options because it has so much <i>more</i> stats than the alternatives. We can struggle a bit with Hit early on. If you find yourself low on Hit, use a <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59493/rigid-cogwheel">
<img alt="Rigid Cogwheel" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enggizmos_30.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rigid Cogwheel</span></a> for a large chunk of it. If you are lucky enough to be settled without it, go for the Crit or Mastery-variant.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62368/arcanum-of-the-dragonmaw">
<img alt="Arcanum of the Dragonmaw" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_masterofelements.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of the Dragonmaw</span></a>, requires Revered reputation with <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_horde.gif");'></span>
<a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1172/dragonmaw-clan">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Dragonmaw Clan</span></a> /<wbr/> <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62422/arcanum-of-the-wildhammer">
<img alt="Arcanum of the Wildhammer" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_masterofelements.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of the Wildhammer</span></a>, requires Revered reputation with <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_alliance.gif");'></span>
<a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1174/wildhammer-clan">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Wildhammer Clan</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
