<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="shoulders-for-frost-death-knight-dps">Shoulders for Frost Death Knight DPS</h4>
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56318/razs-pauldrons">
<img alt="Raz's Pauldrons" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_plate_dungeonplate_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Raz's Pauldrons</span></a> is the choice for the shoulders.  They are easily accessible, as they come from Heroic Blackrock Caverns, which you will be running a lot during your Pre-raid BiS grind.<br/>The hit comes in quite handy, but do note that they are extremely close with <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=63470/missing-diplomats-pauldrons">
<img alt="Missing Diplomat's Pauldrons" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_plate_dungeonplate_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Missing Diplomat's Pauldrons</span></a>, which could potentially sim higher in certain setups.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Shoulder Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62345/greater-inscription-of-jagged-stone">
<img alt="Greater Inscription of Jagged Stone" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_emeraldrough_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greater Inscription of Jagged Stone</span></a> from Exalted reputation with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1171/therazane">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Therazane</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
