<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="chest-for-frost-death-knight-dps">Chest for Frost Death Knight DPS</h4>This is another slot where we are looking to splurge some gold. The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=55060/elementium-deathplate">
<img alt="Elementium Deathplate" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_raidwarrior_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Elementium Deathplate</span></a> comes from Blacksmithing, but as it requires the highly sought after Truegold-material, it is likely to cost a pretty penny early on. However, it is just so much better than its alternatives due to its higher item level and stat budget. Fortunately, it also has a very high amount of Mastery, making it a perfect all-round piece for us.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Chest Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74250/enchant-chest-peerless-stats">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Chest - Peerless Stats</span></a>
