<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="wrist-for-frost-death-knight-dps">Wrist for Frost Death Knight DPS</h4>The wrist slot is easy, as we have two almost equal options, that are both very easy to get. <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=57870/alpha-bracers">
<img alt="Alpha Bracers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_plate_dungeonplate_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Alpha Bracers</span></a> and <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67238/terboruss-rotating-bands">
<img alt="Terborus's Rotating Bands" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_plate_dungeonplate_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Terborus's Rotating Bands</span></a> have very similar stat budgets, a socket, a nice amount of hit and some Mastery that can be reforged into Haste, if you aren't playing Masterfrost. The Alpha bracers are however the alpha by just a smidge, due to their every so slightly higher Mastery.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Bracer Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=96261/enchant-bracer-major-strength">
