<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="waist-for-frost-death-knight-dps">Waist for Frost Death Knight DPS</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=55061/elementium-girdle-of-pain">
<img alt="Elementium Girdle of Pain" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_plate_raidwarrior_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Elementium Girdle of Pain</span></a> is the best by a fair margin, but also expensive. Fortunately, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62384/belt-of-the-ferocious-wolf">
<img alt="Belt of the Ferocious Wolf" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_plate_raiddeathknight_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of the Ferocious Wolf</span></a> is essentially guaranteed to get, as you will eventually get your Hyjal-reputation farmed out. This belt is quite a bit better for Frost than it is for Unholy, but its absence of Hit rating forces you to find it somewhere else, should you not go for the expensive blacksmithing option.<br/>There are good alternatives from reputations, but they will require some less optimal reforges.<div class="pad"></div>
<b>Recommended BiS Waist Enchant for Engineers</b>: <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=41118/nitro-boosts">
<img alt="Nitro Boosts" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gizmo_rocketbootextreme.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nitro Boosts</span></a>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Waist Enchant</b>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=55054/ebonsteel-belt-buckle">
