<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="jewelry">
<span class="c6">Jewelry for Frost Death Knight DPS</span></h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="neck-for-frost-death-knight-dps">Neck for Frost Death Knight DPS</h4>There's just one item here that stands tall above the rest. Luckily, it is also quite easy to obtain. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62447/gift-of-nadun">
<img alt="Gift of Nadun" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklacea7.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gift of Nadun</span></a> can be bought, when exalted with the <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1173/ramkahen">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Ramkahen</span></a>. Make this one of your highest priorities to get, once you have farmed out your Head and Shoulder-enchants.<div class="pad"></div>
