<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="trinkets-for-frost-death-knight-dps">Trinkets for Frost Death Knight DPS</h4>Trinkets are a bit interesting, but fortunately relatively easy to acquire. Do note that a lot of these trinkets are relatively interchangeable and can be mixed and matched depending on whether you prefer active or passive trinkets.<div class="pad"></div>
