<hr/>
<br/>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="weapons">
<span class="c6">Weapons for Frost Death Knight DPS</span></h3>As a Frost Death Knight, you want <b>slow</b> weapons, regardless of regular frost, masterfrost and two-handed frost. Using slower weapons <b>significantly</b> increases the damage of <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=49020/obliterate">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_deathknight_classicon.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Obliterate</span></a> and <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=49143/frost-strike">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_deathknight_empowerruneblade2.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Frost Strike</span></a>. As thus, it is <b>instrumental</b> to your damage that you use slow weapons at all times - ideally something with a swing-speed of 2.6 and above, like <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65171/cookies-tenderizer">
<img alt="Cookie's Tenderizer" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_fabric_silk_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cookie's Tenderizer</span></a>. It cannot be stressed enough how much worse it is to use fast weapons.<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="main-hand-weapons-for-frost-death-knight-dps">Main Hand Weapons for Frost Death Knight DPS</h4>Did you really think that you'd be free from digging? <br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64885/scimitar-of-the-sirocco">
<img alt="Scimitar of the Sirocco" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology_scimitar-of-the-sirocco.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Scimitar of the Sirocco</span></a> from Tol'vir Archeology is our best option going into raiding, simply due to its higher item level - and it's a pain to get. Fortunately, there are decent alternatives from dungeons - but if you are looking to maximize your damage, you should try to get this sword.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=53343/rune-of-razorice">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_frost_frostarmor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rune of Razorice</span></a>
