<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="off-hand-weapons-for-frost-death-knight-dps">Off-Hand Weapons for Frost Death Knight DPS</h4>Bad news. Since <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64885/scimitar-of-the-sirocco">
<img alt="Scimitar of the Sirocco" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology_scimitar-of-the-sirocco.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Scimitar of the Sirocco</span></a> is not unique, it is possible to farm a second one on a different character and send it to your main Death Knight - should you have the tenacity to do so. It is likely not worth the time spent, as getting reputations and professions maxed out is a lot more time efficient than perpetual digging.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=53344/rune-of-the-fallen-crusader">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_retributionaura.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rune of the Fallen Crusader</span></a>
