<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="two-handed-weapons-for-frost-death-knight-dps">Two-Handed Weapons for Frost Death Knight DPS</h4>Should you decide to play with a 2-hander (note, this is quite a bit worse than dual-wield), you have the exact same weapon progression as Unholy Death Knights, with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64377/zinrokh-destroyer-of-worlds">
<img alt="Zin'rokh, Destroyer of Worlds" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology_zinrokh-sword.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Zin'rokh, Destroyer of Worlds</span></a> being your best option pre-raid, lasting you all the way into heroic raids. Note that you <b>cannot</b> play Masterfrost with a two-hander, as you will be losing out on a significant amount of damage by not dual-wielding to benefit from <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=53343/rune-of-razorice">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_frost_frostarmor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rune of Razorice</span></a> as well.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=53344/rune-of-the-fallen-crusader">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_retributionaura.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rune of the Fallen Crusader</span></a>
